      "content": "but it's not just a \"difficult moment.\" it's permanent. the person i was is dead. the community, the career, the identity... all gone. it's like they wiped the hard drive. i'm just this empty shell clicking through the motions of a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. what's even the point of being here if there's nothing left to actually be?",
